    <string name="dialog_help_title">ClipSync Guide</string>
    <string name="dialog_help_content">ClipSync synchronizes your clipboard securely across all your devices on your local Wi-Fi network.\n\n• Automatic Discovery: ClipSync uses mDNS to detect PCs and phones automatically.\n• Background Sync: Enable the Accessibility Service so copying text in any app syncs seamlessly.\n• Firewall: If connecting to a PC, ensure UDP port 9999 is open on your PC\'s firewall.</string>
